{"title": "未知", "index": 453, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre2\">\n<h1 class=\"kindle-cn-heading3\" id=\"sigil_toc_id_9\">第三卷　论道德</h1>\n<p class=\"calibre4\"><br class=\"calibre6\"/>\n<br class=\"calibre6\"/>\n<br class=\"calibre6\"/>\n<br class=\"calibre6\"/>\n<br class=\"calibre6\"/>\n<br class=\"calibre6\"/>\n<br class=\"calibre6\"/>\n<br class=\"calibre6\"/>\n<br class=\"calibre6\"/>\n<br class=\"calibre6\"/>\n<br class=\"calibre6\"/>\n<br class=\"calibre6\"/></p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-signature\">好德者，必先明何以为德；</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-signature\">明德，而后行之勉之。</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-signature\">——路庚</p>\n<div class=\"calibre3\" id=\"calibre_pb_6\"></div>\n</body>"}]}